{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-03T08:33:07.930Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary of what was done:\n\n**New file `src/cli/command-inputs.ts`**\n- `Writer` (`(text: string) => void`), `CommandInputs` (optional `cwd`, `config`, `stdout`, `stderr`)\n- `processStdout` / `processStderr` — the only `src/cli/` file that calls `process.*.write`\n- `resolveInputs` — fills `cwd`/writers with process defaults, returns `config()` that yields the passed config or `loadConfig(cwd)`\n- `commandLogger(inputs, level = 'normal')` — process `osq` logger, or a non-interactive logger over a `node:stream` `Writable` forwarding to the passed `stderr`\n\n**Test capture rewrite**\n- `tests/cli-capture.ts` now hooks `process.stdout.write`/`process.stderr.write` (console calls included), records one `CliLine` per write with one trailing newline stripped, adds exact `stdout`/`stderr` fields, and restores everything even on rejection\n- `captureLogs` in `tests/planning-observed-helpers.ts` records process-stream writes the same way\n- `lint-command-error.test.ts` and `sync-graph-migrate-command-error.test.ts` read from the capture instead of their own hooks\n- New `tests/command-inputs.test.ts` covers the exports, defaults/passed values, logger behavior, and capture fields\n\n**Verification**: both the task `verify` (`tests/command-inputs.test.ts`, 8/8 pass) and the proposal `verify` (`pnpm verify`: typecheck, build, full test suite, lint) pass. Result written to `openspec/changes/142-command-inputs/.run/results/1.md`."}}
